;pylm
; Font styles:
;    0: TDecorate(count=1147, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    1: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=いとひめやま, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=100, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=76, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=えっけん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=みつぎもの, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=1490, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=1330, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\雲を乗り継ぐ冒険.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\walk-tussock1走る.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\林走る.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "32" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―I came down <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="いとひめやま">Mount Itohime</STYLE> and set off for home alone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With this, I too am a full member.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Those who marry into the Arata settlement shut themselves away on Mount Itohime for a year.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes, a whole year has already passed since I came here.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―That day, a year ago.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\結婚式.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
My husband beside me kept the Noh mask on the whole time during the ceremony.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the first words we exchanged―
{PAUSE ""}
it was <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE>'s voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After that my mind went blank, and I could not remember afterward how the ceremony went on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Eventually the ceremony ended―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\神社控室.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Having withdrawn to the back, I shouted to <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE>, who was in the back as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"So it is you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kikyo-dono</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE> took off the Noh mask and showed me his face for the first time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then Father came over―<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Father...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Kikyo</STYLE>, about this..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It was that day, the day <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE> first came to Tokyo.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\江戸城.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
At the castle he had an <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="えっけん">audience</STYLE> with the Emperor and presented the <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="みつぎもの">tribute</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that time, I was told, <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE> made a request of the Emperor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By its nature, the Arata settlement had very few brides coming from outside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was short of women at that very time, and he asked whether a woman who would come to Arata could somehow be found.<PG>
The woman the Arata settlement wanted was one of deep learning and careful thought.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Womanliness and the like came second, since that could be taught in the settlement as much as was needed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He asked to be introduced to a woman who could marry a man of the settlement.<PG>
The Emperor went no further than saying, "I will think on it," but later a suitable woman was found.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That woman, in short, was me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had been named, I was told, as a woman fairly well known as a clever woman and also of an age suited to marriage.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The Emperor's order had been passed to Father, and that was when he told me about the marriage.<PG>
Then <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE> was summoned by the Emperor and came to Tokyo again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE> had heard of it before coming to Tokyo, and
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shouldn't the one you marry be someone you choose freely?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Don't the people concerned have any right to choose?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
he had argued back.<PG>
But that was the norm in this age and this place.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since it was the Emperor, <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE> had no choice but to obey his order.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was why, by the river, <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE> said he understood how I felt.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The two of us, each bound to marry a stranger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Looking back on it now, how comical it was.<PG>
When the Emperor sounded Father out about my marriage, Father had asked about my husband in great detail, I was told.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The more he heard about the husband and about the Arata settlement, the more he thought they might be close to the ideal I was looking for.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Father had called him "a match worthy of me," and that was because I was interested in Western culture and the new age.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Father, in his own way, had truly chosen a match worthy of me.<PG>
Father had been told who the man was, but he had been ordered not to let me know who he was.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because if I were to marry a stranger living in a remote region, I might run away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I ran away, it would bring shame on the Emperor.<PG>
That was why Father had said nothing to the very end.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But no one knew that <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE> and I had already met.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was why things had turned out so comical and strange.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\walk-tussock1走る.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "2" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm home, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kikyo</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! You're safe!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\誰もいない校舎で.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes, I'm one of Arata's people now, aren't I?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah! You really, really did well!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"There was nothing on Mount Itohime, so... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPS>I was reeeeeeally </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>free!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Hahahaha! I see, you were free!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now that the mountain seclusion is over, I can at last be with <STYLE ID="2">Ko-san</STYLE> officially.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From now on, I will be with <STYLE ID="2">Ko-san</STYLE> forever and ever.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------